### Keycloak realm exports
# Issue #238: deploy/keycloak/import/ is the PROD import path (mounted by
# deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml and synced by .github/workflows/
# azure-vm-acr-deploy.yml) — ops drop their own real realm export here on the
# VM; it must never contain a committed file (previously realm-export.json —
# with a public dev client secret and admin/admin — lived here and was picked
# up by prod's --import-realm too). Fully ignored except the placeholder.
# The dev-only baseline realm now lives in deploy/keycloak/dev-import/
# (tracked normally, no ignore rule), used only by docker-compose.override.yml
# and AppHost.cs.
deploy/keycloak/import/*
!deploy/keycloak/import/.gitkeep

